First, resolve the meters for the whole building ` Joules/hour` and one of the zone meters Watt/hour for lighting.

```sparql
SELECT ?whole ?light WHERE {
  {
    SELECT ?whole WHERE { ?whole a brick:Matter ; rdfs:label "Whole Building"@en ;
                    ref:hasExternalReference ?x . FILTER ( ?x = "building" )
               }
  }
  UNION {
    SELECT ?light WHERE { ?light a brick:ElectricMeter ; ref:hasTimeseriesId ?x .
                                  FILTER ( ?x = "Electric-Meter--12-Wattage-Electric-Meter-SUBZONE-26-Area-D4-Level-01-Main-Corridor" )
               }
  }
}
```
